      "quoted": {
        "id": "2083077756447818176",
        "text": "Honestly and this is not sponsored, @grok and @SpaceXAI grok build are just astonishing. I just paid for the promo for grok heavy.\n\nI took a screenshot of a workflow tool, asked Grok Build to make it and it got a working first pass.\n\nFrom there it's taken no longer than 30mins of a handful of prompts etc to turn it into a complete and polished product that can create workflows, then them, debug and supports writing custom tooling.\n\nJust astonishing.",
